==[[Range/Lore|The Range's lore assets]]==
===[[Range/Lore/EP4|Episode 4]]===
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone8.mp3}} "Hey [[Brimstone|Brim]], listen up. So, today's mission got me proper tired. I'mma pass out right now. And you're always going on about getting enough rest, yeah? Like, self-care? So... I was thinking... I should probably skip today's debrief. You know, cause... I gotta look after my health and, like, everyone else was there, and they remember what happened way better cause, I'm tired, right? You don't need me. So, the squad's gonna cover for me. So we're good, yeah? We're good."
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone16.mp3}} "Yo, Big Man. Seriously, tell us what's going on right now. Because me and the others? We're all seeing things like, ghosts or something. Nightmare shit. Flicking lights, cold door handles... it's got us all twitchy, [[Raze]] is freaking out... and you and [[Cypher]] keep doing these... secret meetings. Every time you do it gets all scary, man. So look, I get it. You handle the serious stuff, it's need-to-know, but... you have to give us something. Who are you meeting with? Man, what's going on, we can handle it!"

===[[Range/Lore/EP5|Episode 5]]===
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone32.mp3}} "Ayo Brim, hear me out on this one. We've got a few days 'til our next mission, right? And [[Killjoy]] has these tickets to this massive concert in Berlin! Party of the century, mate! And I think it's really important you let me, and KJ, and [[Raze]], and whoever wants to go, see the show. We'll just pop overseas, see the show, get a bite, and head right back. I promise, I'll play it cool, no stunts, no trouble-making, model citizen, yeah? Thanks boss, you're the man!"

===[[Range/Lore/EP6|Episode 6]]===
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone47.mp3}} "Hey Brim! So... for my [[Radiant]] training, [[Sage]] says I gotta open up more. And the easiest way is to write it out. So, here goes: Dear Brimstone. I hope you're well. I have some things I would like to share. First, thank you for having me on [[VALORANT Protocol|VALORANT]]! Saving the world and using my powers is a dream come true. Second, I know we don't always agree, your rules are too strict. Please consider how crazy a curfew is for grown-arse adults. I would suggest lightening up by 30%? Training with Sage has given me some fresh perspective. I get that I can be a handful sometimes, but my best work comes when I can be myself! I need room to freestyle and spread my wings. If you give me space for that, I can do great things for the team. Third, sorry about the gun range, I'll fix it! Okay, that's it."

===[[Range/Lore/V25|Season 2025]]===
*{{AC|file=VoicemailCypher1.mp3}} "Yo, baby sis, giving me a taste of my own medicine, huh? Not picking up? Huh, right... Sorry I missed your call- uh, calls, yeah... been meaning to call you earlier, just... you know how it is. Hope Lagos is treating you alright. Send Auntie Bukki my best. Last we spoke you were back home in London. No... that must have been years ago, man. Told Mum I'd visit soon too but things keep popping up. My mind's all scrambled... just work stuff I guess. Makes me miss home a bit more. Anyway, not your concern, just been thinking about you is all. Be nice to catch up. How's the music going? You a superstar yet? I wanna know everything, call me back."
*{{AC|file=VoicemailCypher3.mp3}} "Mary, listen. I'm sorry. I wanted to be there, I... I just couldn't. Something important came up at work, you know I can't control my schedule, I don't know what else to say. Sounds like you crushed it though, caught some videos online, your set was fire! Glad you finished your song. I... I didn't realize, but I hear you, okay? I hear you, loud and clear. I'll be there next time, promise."
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone115.mp3}} "Brim, it's Phoenix. We need to move now. KJ's still digging, I get it, but we have enough! Every mission, Toronto, Bangkok, Omega, we went in part-blind and made it out every single one! That was nothing! This is my baby sis, right? Even if there's a chance she's in trouble, then I can't-... I can't just sit here! Give me a team, Brim. Big, small, I don't care. I'll make it work."
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone120.mp3}} "Hey Brim. I'm still thinking about Paris. That was too close for comfort, man, way too close. If our [[Veto|newest recruit]] hadn't come in clutch... I don't even know! And what's next? [[Atlas]] is down, but the war's not over. [[Mary Adeyemi|Mary]]'s not the only one at risk, we need something for all our families! Surveillance, emergency protocols, whatever ensures their safety year-round. Not sure what that looks like but it's something to think about. Oh, one last thing. Don't be shocked by a few requests from me to swing home. I know, it's not really my style, but it's long overdue."

